<title>USA: Cominco files for $300 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>Cominco files for $300 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cominco Ltd filed Tuesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $300 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>The company said the offering includes $109.4 million of previously registered but unsold debt securities.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to finance capital expenditures and working capital requirements; repay bank loans, debentures and notes; and for other general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>No underwriters were listed in the filing.</p>
</text>
